      "severity": "major",
      "status": "resolved",
      "descriptionMarkdown": "**Expected:** `.github/workflows/pr-test.yml` installs `nightly-2026-06-23` (with `rust-src` and wasm32) in every job whose steps now run `cargo +nightly-2026-06-23`. **Observed:** the install step was added only to the `wasm-playwright` job (line ~124). The `rust-validation` job (name \"Rust Workspace\") still sets up only stable and then runs `cargo run -p xtask -- app apps/lab build wasm` and `app apps/test_suite build wasm ...` (lines ~87-90). Those now invoke `cargo +nightly-2026-06-23 build -Z build-std`, and a dated toolchain cannot be a runner-preinstalled `nightly`, so the job fails with 'toolchain is not installed'. **Repair:** add the same 'Setup the threaded-WASM nightly' step (`dtolnay/rust-toolchain@master`, `toolchain: nightly-2026-06-23`, `components: rust-src`, `targets: wasm32-unknown-unknown`) to `rust-validation` after 'Setup Rust' (or rustup-install it via `rustup toolchain install nightly-2026-06-23 --profile minimal --component rust-src --target wasm32-unknown-unknown`), and update the reference table in `wasm-toolchain-update.md` accordingly.",
